<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Murphy Oil raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Murphy Oil raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs has raised its rating for Murphy Oil Corp to trading buy from market perform, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened up 1-1/8 to 49-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
